# Context for api/Dockerfile.worker is the repository root; send only what the
# build needs (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
**
!api/pyproject.toml
!api/README.md
!api/alembic.ini
!api/src/**
!collector/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
collector/bin
collector/coverage.out
